  "limits": "VfatWrite takes a pointer to context pointer. CcCopyWrite arguments at ESP are FileObject,Offset pointer,Length,Wait,Buffer. AL is Boolean on return. Entry MDL reads use an existing mapped address only, without mapping guest pages. Entry file EOF is a snapshot, not a locked final append offset. buffer_ready captures EAX after VfatGetUserBuffer, context EBP-100, clipped Length EBP-124, resolved offset EBP-96, before the pointer is stored at EBP-136."
